#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0450 expect=skipped domain=TS
#note "PLAN-per-row-functions phase 0: the no-dictionary SKIP pin of CDISC-CG0450 (unii, K4-DICT). Violating-shaped data (row 2) but #dictionaries is DELIBERATELY ABSENT, so the rule MUST report SKIPPED, never a false PASS and never a finding. Red under the W3 S3a/S3b sabotage by design."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-3
dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
---
S01 | TS | 1 | TRT | ASPIRIN
S01 | TS | 2 | TRT | PARACETAMOL
S01 | TS | 3 | AGEMAX | PARACETAMOL
